OL,3,AUS hits three Iranian oil tankers after
OL,4,Asaying its warships were targeted
OL,5,
OL,6,FCentcom said it "successfully evaded"
OL,7,Fmultiple attacks from the Islamic
OL,8,FRevolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC)
OL,9,Ftargeting a US aircraft carrier and
OL,10,Fguided-missile destroyer. No American
OL,11,Ftroops were harmed, it said in a
OL,12,Fstatement.
OL,14,FIranian state media earlier reported
OL,15,Fthat one of its oil tankers had been
OL,16,Fstruck by US missiles off the coast of
OL,17,FKharg Island.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
